      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "بعد الزيادة: $x\\left(1 + \\dfrac{t}{100}\\right)$",
          "بعد التخفيض: $y = x\\left(1 + \\dfrac{t}{100}\\right)\\left(1 - \\dfrac{t}{100}\\right)$",
          "$y = \\left(1 - \\dfrac{t^2}{10000}\\right)x$"
        ]
      },
